#: assets/js/build/options.js
msgid "Tracking mode"
msgstr ""

#: assets/js/build/options.js
msgid "Normal stores a row per click with raw fields (IP, referrer, country, timestamp) — fast and covers most reports. Extended also parses the user agent to populate browser, device, and OS breakdowns, at extra cost on every redirect. Simple only increments a per-link counter — fastest, smallest database, but disables every report except total clicks."
