msgid "Compatibility options for unusual server or plugin setups."
msgstr ""

#: assets/js/build/options.js
msgid "Record clicks synchronously (compatibility mode)"
msgstr ""

#: assets/js/build/options.js
msgid "Leave this off unless clicks are going missing. By default Pretty Links records each click just after the visitor is redirected, which keeps redirects fast. Turn it on only if clicks are not being recorded for logged-out visitors — a tell-tale sign is clicks counting while you are logged in but not for regular visitors. That is usually another plugin (often a security or activity-log plugin, e.g. SiteGround Security Optimizer) ending the request early and cutting off the deferred write. This option records the click during the redirect instead — reliable, but slightly slower. Note: it does not affect the separate high-speed redirect (independent redirects / mu-plugin); if you use that, turn the mu-plugin off instead."
msgstr ""

